  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Psychosocial support for GBV at Lydia Center, Goma ASPLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Psychosocial support for survivors of sexual and gender-based violence at Lydia Center, Goma. Literacy and numeracy, life skills, microcredits, reinsertion kits, psychotherapy will be provided to SGBV survivors by ASPLC in North Kivu</narrative>
  </description>
